# Whitelist: only the source, build files, docs and fonts are published.
# Everything REICO writes while running (your settings, desktop layout, game
# lists, presets, logs) and build output stays out of the repository.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!main.cpp
!reico.rc
!reico.ico
!build.bat
!reico_autoscale.py
!docs/
!docs/*.png
!fonts/
!fonts/Inter-Regular.ttf
!fonts/Inter-Medium.ttf
!fonts/Inter-SemiBold.ttf
!fonts/Inter-Bold.ttf
!fonts/Inter-LICENSE.txt
